                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A nice relaxing shmup with mamorukun-style controls, works great on an arcade stick (with joytokey).\nLots of secrets to find in order to upgrade your weapons and so on.\nThe first level, I think, should have been the second stage as it's a sort of labyrinthine forest that it's easy to get lost in and doesn't give the best impression of the game.\nHad great fun running through the game on normal and have just started a new run on hard.\nThere's a survival mode too with different maps that you can unlock by finding all the items.\nIt's free and I'd gladly have paid a couple of quid for this.",
